<title>UK: BayerVB sets 150 mln Sfr bond due 2007.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 150 mln Sfr bond due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bank Von Ernst and CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN CHF   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    21.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE    21.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/=     DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED. THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
